message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "ekstraklasa-model: cards and fouls in the Polish Ekstraklasa, tested on unseen matches"
abstract: >-
  A measurement project on cards and fouls in the Polish Ekstraklasa: referee, teams and
  players, every idea tested against a simple baseline on matches the model has not seen,
  with the market used only as a check. Method, findings with sample sizes, rejected and
  open hypotheses, and the project timeline.
